{
 "no": 86,
 "title": "10.3 分式的加减",
 "label": "八下·10.3",
 "part": "八下 第10章 分式",
 "url": "https://basic.smartedu.cn/tchMaterial/detail?contentType=assets_document&contentId=e2eb2248-6d8e-44fc-a1ef-a1eaead72992&catalogType=tchMaterial&subCatalog=tchMaterial",
 "paragraphs": [
  "与分数加减运算类似，分式加减运算包含同分母分式加减运算与异分母分式加减运算。",
  "讨论",
  "怎样计算 $\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{2}{a}$ 和 $\\frac{3}{a}-\\frac{1}{b}$？",
  "与分数加减运算的法则类似，分式加减运算的法则是：",
  "同分母的分式相加减，分母不变，把分子相加减。",
  "异分母的分式相加减，先通分，再加减。",
  "用符号表示为：$\\frac{b}{a}\\pm\\frac{c}{a}=\\frac{b\\pm c}{a}$，$\\frac{b}{a}\\pm\\frac{c}{d}=\\frac{bd}{ad}\\pm\\frac{ac}{ad}=\\frac{bd\\pm ac}{ad}$。",
  "例1",
  "计算：",
  "(1) $\\frac{5}{a}+\\frac{4}{a}$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{2a-3}{a+1}-\\frac{a-2}{a+1}$。",
  "解",
  "(1) $\\frac{5}{a}+\\frac{4}{a}=\\frac{5+4}{a}=\\frac{9}{a}$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{2a-3}{a+1}-\\frac{a-2}{a+1}$",
  "$=\\frac{(2a-3)-(a-2)}{a+1}$",
  "$=\\frac{2a-3-a+2}{a+1}$",
  "$=\\frac{a-1}{a+1}$。",
  "例2",
  "计算：",
  "(1) $\\frac{2}{x}-\\frac{5}{x^2}$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{a+1}{a-1}-\\frac{a-1}{a+1}$．",
  "解",
  "(1) $\\frac{2}{x}-\\frac{5}{x^2}=\\frac{2\\cdot x}{x\\cdot x}-\\frac{5}{x^2}=\\frac{2x}{x^2}-\\frac{5}{x^2}=\\frac{2x-5}{x^2}$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{a+1}{a-1}-\\frac{a-1}{a+1}=\\frac{(a+1)(a+1)}{(a+1)(a-1)}-\\frac{(a-1)(a-1)}{(a+1)(a-1)}$",
  "$=\\frac{(a+1)^2-(a-1)^2}{(a+1)(a-1)}$",
  "$=\\frac{(a^2+2a+1)-(a^2-2a+1)}{(a+1)(a-1)}$",
  "$=\\frac{4a}{(a+1)(a-1)}=\\frac{4a}{a^2-1}$．",
  "讨论",
  "判断并说明下列变形是否正确：$\\frac{n}{-m}=\\frac{-n}{m}=-\\frac{n}{m}$．",
  "$\\frac{n}{-m}=\\frac{(-1)\\cdot n}{(-1)\\cdot (-m)}=\\frac{-n}{m}$．",
  "$\\frac{-n}{m}+\\frac{n}{m}=\\frac{-n+n}{m}=0$．",
  "例3",
  "计算：",
  "(1) $p+\\frac{np}{m-n}$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{x}{x^2-4}-\\frac{1}{2-x}$．",
  "解",
  "(1) $p+\\frac{np}{m-n}=\\frac{p}{1}+\\frac{np}{m-n}$",
  "$=\\frac{p(m-n)}{m-n}+\\frac{np}{m-n}$",
  "$=\\frac{p(m-n)+np}{m-n}=\\frac{pm}{m-n}$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{x}{x^2-4}-\\frac{1}{2-x}=\\frac{x}{(x+2)(x-2)}+\\frac{1}{x-2}$",
  "$=\\frac{x}{(x+2)(x-2)}+\\frac{x+2}{(x+2)(x-2)}$",
  "$=\\frac{x+x+2}{(x+2)(x-2)}=\\frac{2x+2}{x^2-4}$．",
  "通常，分式相加减所得的结果应化为最简分式或整式．",
  "练习",
  "1. 计算：",
  "(1) $\\frac{c}{ab^2}+\\frac{bc}{ab^2}$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{3}{a}+\\frac{a-15}{5a}$；",
  "(3) $\\frac{1}{R_1}+\\frac{1}{R_2}$；",
  "(4) $\\frac{b}{a-b}+\\frac{ab}{b^2-a^2}$．",
  "2. 小明化简分式$\\frac{3}{(x-2)(x+1)}-\\frac{1}{x-2}$出现了错误，其解答过程如下：",
  "原式$=\\frac{3}{(x-2)(x+1)}-\\frac{x+1}{(x-2)(x+1)}$（第一步）",
  "$=\\frac{3-x+1}{(x-2)(x+1)}$（第二步）",
  "$=\\frac{4-x}{(x-2)(x+1)}$．（第三步）",
  "(1) 小明的解答过程是从第______步开始出错的，其错误的原因是______；",
  "(2) 请写出此题正确的解答过程．",
  "例4",
  "已知$a>b>0$，试比较$\\frac{1}{a}$与$\\frac{1}{b}$的大小．",
  "解",
  "$\\frac{1}{a}-\\frac{1}{b}=\\frac{b}{ab}-\\frac{a}{ab}=\\frac{b-a}{ab}$．",
  "因为$a>b>0$，所以$b-a<0$，$ab>0$．所以$\\frac{b-a}{ab}<0$．",
  "因为$\\frac{1}{a}-\\frac{1}{b}=\\frac{b-a}{ab}$，所以$\\frac{1}{a}-\\frac{1}{b}<0$．所以$\\frac{1}{a}<\\frac{1}{b}$．",
  "讨论",
  "如果$a<b<0$，那么$\\frac{1}{a}<\\frac{1}{b}$是否依然成立？",
  "例5",
  "证明：$\\frac{1}{n(n+1)}=\\frac{1}{n}-\\frac{1}{n+1}$．",
  "证明",
  "因为右边$=\\frac{1}{n}-\\frac{1}{n+1}=\\frac{n+1}{n(n+1)}-\\frac{n}{n(n+1)}=\\frac{n+1-n}{n(n+1)}=\\frac{1}{n(n+1)}$，",
  "左边$=\\frac{1}{n(n+1)}$，",
  "所以左边$=$右边．即$\\frac{1}{n(n+1)}=\\frac{1}{n}-\\frac{1}{n+1}$．",
  "探究",
  "计算：$\\frac{1}{1×2}+\\frac{1}{2×3}+\\frac{1}{3×4}+\\cdots+\\frac{1}{2025×2026}$．",
  "练习",
  "1. 已知$a>b>0$，试比较$\\frac{b}{a}$与$\\frac{b+1}{a+1}$的大小．",
  "2. 已知$a>0$，$b>0$，试比较$\\frac{2ab}{a+b}$与$\\frac{a+b}{2}$的大小．",
  "习题",
  "1. 计算：",
  "（1）$\\frac{a}{a-b}-\\frac{b}{a-b}$；",
  "（2）$\\frac{a^2}{(a-b)^3}-\\frac{b^2}{(b-a)^3}$；",
  "（3）$\\frac{b^2}{4a^2}-\\frac{c}{a}$；",
  "（4）$a-b+\\frac{2b^2}{a+b}$；",
  "（5）$\\frac{x-2}{x^2+4x+4}-\\frac{1}{x+2}$；",
  "（6）$\\frac{x^2}{x^4-4}-\\frac{1}{x^2+2}$．",
  "2. 已知$a>0$且$a≠1$，试比较$\\frac{a+1}{2}$与$\\frac{2a}{a+1}$的大小．",
  "3. 在甲商店用$a$元可以购买$b$件相同的商品，在乙商店中再加10元可以购买三倍数量的同款商品，这款商品在乙商店的单价是否比甲商店更低？",
  "4. 证明：$\\frac{1}{x(x+1)}+\\frac{1}{(x+1)(x+2)}+\\frac{1}{(x+2)(x+3)}=\\frac{3}{x(x+3)}$．"
 ],
